{"4155900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marble Hero", "steam_appid": 4155900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual, relaxing physics-based game that combines elements of pinball and billiards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash! Smash! Bounce! All you need is to play by sliding the mouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse or touchscreen to control your character. Set the dash direction and speed, then launch marbles to hit enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155900/extras/53fceabee07e4133e2c01178ea1b012c.avif?t=1768015659\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate rebound angles and positions, avoid traps, or push enemies into traps. Defeat all enemies to win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The types of traps in each scene increase over time, and when placed together, they can create combo effects, sometimes causing great chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155900/extras/e0406f663772946dffe6c6249b835fe9.avif?t=1768015659\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two characters: one melee fighter and one ranged fighter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their combat styles and strategies differ, so observe the map and choose the appropriate character for the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155900/extras/a43c79b752b52411faeddfcf8e5343f5.avif?t=1768015659\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of maps, and after completing them, you can play on higher difficulty randomly generated maps.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual, relaxing physics-based game that combines elements of pinball and billiards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash! Smash! Bounce! All you need is to play by sliding the mouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse or touchscreen to control your character. Set the dash direction and speed, then launch marbles to hit enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155900/extras/53fceabee07e4133e2c01178ea1b012c.avif?t=1768015659\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate rebound angles and positions, avoid traps, or push enemies into traps. Defeat all enemies to win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The types of traps in each scene increase over time, and when placed together, they can create combo effects, sometimes causing great chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155900/extras/e0406f663772946dffe6c6249b835fe9.avif?t=1768015659\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two characters: one melee fighter and one ranged fighter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their combat styles and strategies differ, so observe the map and choose the appropriate character for the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155900/extras/a43c79b752b52411faeddfcf8e5343f5.avif?t=1768015659\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of maps, and after completing them, you can play on higher difficulty randomly generated maps.</p>", "short_description": "A casual game: Dash! Crash! Bounce! Simply slide your mouse to play. Control the marble, set the direction 